---
alwaysApply: true
---
- Do not add namespaces to C# files, but to `GlobalUsings.cs`
- no single line statements, always use curly brackets to enclose code on separate lines
- NEVER put a lambda into a designer file, it breaks the WinForm editor!
- NO RUNTIME COMPONENT INITIALIZATION, ALL MUST BE IN WinForms' Designer.cs file!!!
- WinForm event handlers on components should always be within the Designer.cs file, not in code-behind!
